cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mirage OCR"
abstract: >-
  A web app that reads text out of images and PDFs with Mirage, the 22 MB
  vision model from Cactus Compute. Pages are cut into overlapping windows
  because Mirage reads from a 16 x 16 grid of 32 px cells.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Iamkprasad/mirage-ocr"
url: "https://github.com/Iamkprasad/mirage-ocr"
keywords:
  - ocr
  - text-recognition
  - pdf
  - vision-language-model
  - on-device
  - cactus-compute
  - mirage
